Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.170
- This video is brought
to you by Dashlane.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:04.370
You hear on TV a lot that there's

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.310
no such thing as collusion.

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.730
- Sitting here looking
into the federal code

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.260
trying to find collusion as a crime.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.390
- It's not.
- Collusion is not a crime.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.530
- The Trump Tower meeting was not a crime,

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:15.850
it was not collusion.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.240
- Collusion is not a crime.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.170
- And it's true.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.010
You can look through the entire US code,

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:25.110
and not find a single
crime called collusion.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:28.300
And while that's true, that
misses the point entirely.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.730
That isn't the end of the inquiry,

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.490
that is the very beginning.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.440
Collusion is a shorthand.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.480
And what people mean
when they use that term

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.723
is actually much, much worse.

00:00:40.114 --> 00:00:42.614
(gavel bangs)

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.630
Hey LegalEagles, welcome
back to Lawsplainer,

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.210
where we explain the most important

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:49.420
legal concepts of the day.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.530
Don't forget to subscribe
and hit that bell for more

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.920
legal explanations, and of course leave

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.730
your comments in the form of objections.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:59.030
Today, we're talking about collusion.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:00:59.863
What is it?

00:00:59.863 --> 00:01:01.050
What is it not?

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.110
And what do people actually
mean when they refer

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:05.520
to the broad rubric of collusion?

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:07.970
What crimes may fit under that umbrella?

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:10.780
Now, to understand what collusion is,

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.810
I have to give yo a little
background on the nature

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.550
of a criminal conspiracy
and accomplice liability.

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:18.260
Because people often use
the terms conspiracy,

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:21.060
collusion, and aiding and
abetting or accomplice

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.040
liability almost interchangeably.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.420
They're actually very different things

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:26.860
and have very different implications.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.880
First, what is a conspiracy?

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.910
A conspiracy is an agreement by two

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:34.000
or more persons to commit a criminal act.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.290
That agreement can be
explicit or can be implicit,

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:38.770
that's not actually
have to be written down

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:40.650
in some sort of contracts somewhere.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:43.310
And generally, a
conspiracy does not require

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:46.790
an overt act, just an agreement to engage

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.740
in some sort of criminal act.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:49.890
Unlike aiding and abetting

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:51.980
which we'll get to in just a second.

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:54.320
Now it's really important for
the purposes of this collusion

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:56.810
discussion is that under federal law,

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:59.420
a party to a conspiracy is responsible

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:03.090
for any criminal act
committed by a co-conspirator,

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:07.330
so long as that act falls within
the scope of the conspiracy

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:10.650
or is a foreseeable
consequence of that conspiracy.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:14.070
So if you enter into a criminal
conspiracy, you can be held

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.830
liable for any of the acts
of your co-conspirators,

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.590
regardless of whether you
did the thing in question.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.660
Now a similar but different concept

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.670
in criminal law is called
accomplice liability,

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:26.083
commonly called aiding and abetting.

00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:27.970
Aiding and abetting does not require

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:30.970
any kind of agreement,
only that the accomplice

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.790
commit or attempt to commit some act

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:36.930
with the intent of
furthering the primary crime.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:39.100
And that includes, for
example, buying a gun

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.350
and giving it to a bank robber

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:42.220
in furtherance of a bank heist.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.510
But it also includes post crime conduct,

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:46.340
like helping the robber get away

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:49.000
or hiding evidence of the crime itself.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.560
And sometimes, even offering encouragement

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:55.100
counts as an act in
furtherance of the crime

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.710
sufficient to create accomplice liability.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.900
Even attempted aid, even
if it's not successful,

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:03.050
is usually enough in most jurisdictions

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.550
to be guilty of the primary crime.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.820
But both conspiracy
and aiding and abetting

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.010
require an underlying crime.

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:12.120
You can't convict someone of a conspiracy

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:15.300
unless they conspired
to do something illegal.

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:17.040
And you can't aid and abet something

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.840
that is totally legal.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:21.710
But where there is
underlying criminal conducts,

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.610
generally, the conspirators
and the accomplices

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:28.410
are as guilty as the person
who pulls the trigger itself.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:31.120
So even if the members of
the Trump administration

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.950
were not the gunman, so to speak,

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:36.280
they can still be held
liable if they engage

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:39.050
in a conspiracy to commit
some sort of criminal act

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:41.590
or aided and abetted some criminal act

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.460
and acted in furtherance of that.

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:47.070
But for liability to attach
in the context of collusion,

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:51.050
there still must be an
original illegal predicate act.

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:53.870
So what could those predicate acts be?

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:56.190
Well based on public
reports, there's actually

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:58.170
a long list of things that may potentially

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.330
give rise to criminal liability.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:02.680
The first is potentially
aiding and abetting

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.340
or conspiracy to conduct computer crimes.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.570
This is generally speaking all

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.530
of the hacking related activities.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:10.540
There's a whole raft of potential crimes

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.350
under the Computer Fraud
and Abuse Act among others,

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:15.300
including accessing private information,

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:19.480
trespassing on computers,
and peddling stolen data.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.540
This could apply if anyone actually helped

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:25.070
the hackers break into the
Democratic National Committee,

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.430
or if anyone helped out those hackers

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.480
after the deed was
done, that could qualify

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:31.780
as either a conspiracy
or aiding and abetting.

00:04:32.822 --> 00:04:35.030
(beeping)

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.090
- [Child] Salutations, hacker.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.033
Would you like to disrupt democracy?

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:44.331
Enjoy your stay.

00:04:44.331 --> 00:04:45.460
(criminal screams)

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:47.550
- In addition, all of
these acts could qualify

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.440
as a conspiracy to
defraud the United States,

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.520
which reaches financial and property loss

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.780
through the use of a scheme
or artifice to defraud,

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:58.380
but it's also designed
and intended to protect

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:00.020
the integrity of the United States,

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:03.260
its agency's programs and policies.

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.810
Some of what is alleged
might qualify as bribery

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:09.550
of officials or individuals.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:12.490
There may be a fair amount
of money laundering going on

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:15.330
from foreign governments
or foreign officials.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:17.780
There are allegations that
people who are not allowed

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:20.690
to bring money into United
States may have done so

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.640
through intermediaries like
the National Rifle Association

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:26.610
or through potential
real estate transactions

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:28.550
where oversight is minimal.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.700
So if there was illegal money funneled

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.230
into the United States and
there was a failure to pay

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.900
the correct taxes on it, which could

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:37.320
give rise to federal tax evasion claims,

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:39.820
but also similarly state
tax evasion claims,

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.900
because the state governments
tend to tax exactly

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.800
the same things that the federal
government taxes as well.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.410
These allegations might also give rise

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.960
to a conspiracy to commit election fraud,

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.490
including illegal
solicitation of donations

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.700
above federal limits.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.410
Individuals and corporations paying

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:58.150
more than allowed under
campaign finance laws,

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.450
which is also a campaign
finance violation.

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:02.220
It appears that there
is very strong evidence

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:04.260
of foreign influence on the election

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.500
through fraudulent news
stories and social media posts.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.210
There may be a conspiracy to engage in

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:12.490
and cover up campaign finance violations,

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.570
apart from just the monetary ones,

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:16.870
including in-kind donations
where the president

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.240
may have received something of value

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.500
that wasn't actual money,
like a friend buying

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:24.700
and killing potentially
harmful tabloid stories.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:27.050
There could be wire and mail fraud.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:28.460
Of course, hiding in plain sight

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.670
may be the president's
emoluments violations,

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:33.040
by virtue of the fact that
he's operating a business

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.190
that receives millions of dollars in funds

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:37.390
from foreign nationals
and foreign governments.

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:39.910
There are the Logan Act and FARA claims

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:43.030
on the basis that several
members of the Trump campaign

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.040
engaged in foreign influence peddling

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:47.310
without registering as a foreign agent.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:49.310
Then there are the whole raft of crimes

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:51.810
that may have been
conducted in conjunction

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:54.810
with the investigation
into the original crimes,

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.186
which include things like
obstruction of justice,

00:06:57.186 --> 00:07:00.880
perjury, making false statements,
and witness tampering,

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:04.330
which may be evidenced by
President Trump's own tweets

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.230
where arguably he was trying to influence,

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.010
intimidate, or impede
witnesses who either have

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:12.200
already given testimony
or will give testimony

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.750
in the Mueller investigation.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.540
And on top of that, there is
a potential RICO violation.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.310
I've handled a few RICO claims,

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:21.120
and I usually tend to agree
with Ken White, @Popehat,

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.310
who says that it's never ever RICO.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:28.000
Except that this is a possibility
for a RICO claim here.

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.240
We'll see how it unfolds, but
RICO is incredibly complicated

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.530
and usually unnecessary,
especially given the dozens

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.670
of crimes that we have
already talked about

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:40.820
which may give rise to conspiracy
or accomplice liability.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:42.170
So while it's true that there is

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:44.700
no such thing as the crime of collusion,

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:48.150
what's actually out there
is much, much worse.

